# 统一换行：仓库内保存 LF，Windows 检出时按文件类型处理
* text=auto

# Shell 脚本必须保持 LF，否则在 Git Bash / Linux 下会因 \r 报错
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件不做换行转换
*.jar binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.ppt binary
*.pptx binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary